+## Focused-task selection audit (P-001, run 43638934408, 2026-11-14)
+
+Question: does explicit highest-value focused-task selection improve information
+flow relative to the earlier opportunistic (queue/receipt-driven) task choice?
+
+Evidence inspected (durable only, no new experiments):
+- Frontier-first sequence (8 activations, 6 distinct new signal classes, each
+  closed once with an independent verifier): 37263008074 mean reversion
+  FALSIFIED; 37304873966 cross-sectional relative strength FALSIFIED;
+  37314710995 volatility targeting FALSIFIED; 37318950814 momentum SUPPORTED
+  (candidate positive); 37361000967 momentum lookback sweep (qualification of
+  the admitted candidate); 37394344201 momentum longer-horizon 20/60
+  (qualification); 37414038601 20-day breakout FALSIFIED; 63-day
+  cross-sectional momentum FALSIFIED (`state/check_artifacts/*`).
+  No falsified cell was re-tested in this sequence.
+- Prior opportunistic stretch on the already-rejected MA(20/60) family:
+  AAPL regime blocks, NVDA regime blocks, 10-asset universe sweep, per-asset
+  t-statistics, AMZN/JPM regime deep-dive, regime-adaptive MA rescue, and a
+  richer-regime-feature rescue (STATE.md sections "regime-stability on real
+  data" through "REGIME_STABLE_LOSS verdict label; regime-feature diagnostic").
+  Seven activations, all negative, zero new signal classes opened.
+
+Assessment:
+- CONCRETE ADVANTAGE (observed): cell coverage per activation and elimination of
+  repeat work on a closed cell. The earlier stretch spent seven activations
+  deepening one rejected family; the frontier-first stretch closed six distinct
+  classes in eight activations with an independent verifier each time.
+- NOT DEMONSTRATED (causal): "better information flow per unit of worker time"
+  is not established. There is no control or alternating assignment; the
+  frontier artifact itself (not the selection rule) may carry the effect;
+  toolkit/verification cost fell over the same period; the pre-period also
+  contained infrastructure-building activations whose value is not comparable
+  on a cell-coverage metric; and n is small.
+- Selection quality is also unverified: "highest-value" is a controller-assigned
+  qualitative priority, so this audit can confirm that selected cells were
